          <div class="svc-trigger"><div class="svc-trigger-num">4</div><div>You <strong>acquired or merged</strong> and need to integrate two different security architectures.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-trigger"><div class="svc-trigger-num">5</div><div>A <strong>CISO or Head of IT transition</strong> has put the architecture on the agenda and needs a defensible baseline.</div></div>
