          <div class="svc-process-row"><div class="svc-process-row-num">04</div><div><div class="svc-process-row-step">Target-state design</div><div class="svc-process-row-duration">3 – 4 days</div></div><div class="svc-process-row-desc">Target architecture authoring, gap analysis, effort estimation, roadmap sequencing.</div></div>
          <div class="svc-process-row"><div class="svc-process-row-num">05</div><div><div class="svc-process-row-step">Workshop &amp; handover</div><div class="svc-process-row-duration">2 hours</div></div><div class="svc-process-row-desc">Live architecture walkthrough with IT and security leadership covering design rationale and roadmap sequencing.</div></div>
